flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/a-bind-of-the-runtime-directory.zon: flong.box drives containers.box, and would bind /run/user/1000 into a session. That reaches flong's state, the user manager's bus or private socket, /proc, the cgroup filesystem or a path in flong.box.protect, any of which lets a session act as the caller outside it. The check here is lexical; the launcher's canonical one refuses the rest at launch.
